  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Creates a framework and incentives for robotics R&D, manufacturing and deployment, applying to public-space operation, commercial human-interacting robots, road transport robots and care robots.",
   "ANIA, via a Robotics Division, is the competent authority: risk assessment, safety standards, enforcement, mutual recognition of foreign certification.",
   "Three-tier risk classification (basic, intermediate, high) of robotics operations.",
   "Allocates responsibility among designers, integrators, deployers, operators and end users, with incident responsibility based on role and control.",
   "Principles of human primacy and physical safety, plus outcome-based, proportionate and competitive regulation; drones and hobbyists excluded."
